Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:49.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\N"The Forbidden Sacred Ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:54.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Island Where God Lives\Nand Heaven's Judgement!"
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.24,0:01:56.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's actually a God?!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.74,0:01:58.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And he lives on an\Nisland up here
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.37,0:02:00.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that no one's\Nallowed to walk on?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.96,0:02:04.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He does.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.17,0:02:05.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that everyone\Nnoticed the big sign
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.55,0:02:07.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that said "Godland Skypiea."
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.34,0:02:11.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That means this land is ruled\Nby the almighty God Eneru.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.39,0:02:13.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,God's name is Eneru?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.35,0:02:18.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He knows and sees everything.\NHe's truly omniscient.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.60,0:02:20.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NEverything?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.08,0:02:24.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He keeps his all-seeing eyes\Nfocused on everyone. Always.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.21,0:02:25.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.09,0:02:26.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like right now?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.09,0:02:27.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NOh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:29.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:30.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hate it when people stare\Nat me and I can't see them!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.73,0:02:34.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NAMI]\NI can't get over\Nthe size of those trees.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.19,0:02:35.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.61,0:02:39.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So they do have earthen\Nground up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.41,0:02:45.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.87,0:02:48.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A place we're not allowed to\Ngo to no matter what, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:49.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.98,0:02:50.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've seen that look in\Nyour eyes before, Luffy,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and it always gets\Nus into trouble!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.25,0:02:53.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When the lady says\Nwe can't go there
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.96,0:02:56.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because it's sacred or whatever,\Nthat's exactly what she means!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.34,0:02:57.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We cannot go there!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.72,0:02:59.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am not letting you drag me\Ndown with you this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. Hey. Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.65,0:03:05.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I understand we're not\Nsupposed to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.15,0:03:06.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.86,0:03:09.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.40,0:03:13.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You really think I'm the kinda\Nguy who would do that? Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:15.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[STRAW HATS]\N– Yes. Absolutely.\N– Yes. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:19.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If this guy is God, then\Nshouldn't he forgive you
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.88,0:03:21.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,no matter what you do?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.17,0:03:22.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Walking around on some\Nforbidden island
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,doesn't seem like\Na big deal to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.34,0:03:25.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.55,0:03:27.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Breaking any law set\Nforth by our almighty
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.31,0:03:29.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is nothing less than sacrilege.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.85,0:03:32.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSo I guess it\Ndoesn't matter either way.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.33,0:03:35.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHe'd go even if it\Nmeant he'd die in the process.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.39,0:03:38.47,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[SANJI]\NNami! Nami...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.55,0:03:40.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's go\Nand find her!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.43,0:03:41.52,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We're wasting time!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.60,0:03:42.81,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[USOPP]\NYou don't care\Nabout saving Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.89,0:03:44.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You just wanna satisfy\Nyour twisted urge
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.69,0:03:47.60,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}to do the exact opposite\Nof what you've been told!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:54.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThose are the biggest\Ntrees I've ever seen in my life.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.54,0:03:56.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They've gotta be\Nhundreds of years old.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.50,0:04:00.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That, or things grow bigger\Na few miles up in the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.34,0:04:02.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And they're so tall.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.27,0:04:06.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't even see\Nwhere they top out.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.00,0:04:11.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we gotta get going.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.22,0:04:13.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah, I know.\NJust gimme a second.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.68,0:04:15.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine. Don't listen to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.22,0:04:17.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you're gonna feel awful\Nif something bad happens to Nami
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.35,0:04:19.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,while you're busy\Nstuffing your face.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.43,0:04:21.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The food'll be here\Nwhen we get back!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.52,0:04:23.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NMh-hm. I'm right behind you.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.85,0:04:25.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis, I know this guy,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.08,0:04:27.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I could be here\Nall day waiting on him.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.54,0:04:29.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could you tell me how to\Nget to the Upper Yard?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.21,0:04:30.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I gotta go help Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.83,0:04:32.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:33.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHm?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.84,0:04:34.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,About Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:36.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She might just be\Nout on the clouds
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.13,0:04:37.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and nowhere near the Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.05,0:04:39.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.26,0:04:43.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NI can't explain how\Ndevastating it could be to us
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.47,0:04:45.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to incur the wrath\Nof our God Eneru.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.16,0:04:49.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZABO]\NHelp!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.10,0:04:55.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZABO]\NSomebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:00.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't live like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.43,0:05:01.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:02.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.23,0:05:13.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whistling]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:28.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:32.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOLY THE DOG whines]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:37.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:40.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bastard. He took my prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:44.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThose voices. Those sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:47.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:49.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.67,0:05:51.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHURA]\NJust give up!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.67,0:05:53.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI]\NYou should do the same.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This boy is mine! Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.38,0:05:56.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not if I can help it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.67,0:05:59.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI]\NOh, but it doesn't\Nlook like you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.43,0:06:03.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.81,0:06:11.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:13.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.15,0:06:15.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something tells me\NI don't wanna find out.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.36,0:06:16.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.22,0:06:20.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NHmm. So this is\Nyour old waver, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.46,0:06:23.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should take\Nbetter care of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.50,0:06:25.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not ours. We found\Nit like that that.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.71,0:06:27.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NWould you like me\Nto take a look at it?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.72,0:06:30.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Assuming it's fixable, I should\Nbe able to do that for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.82,0:06:33.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm an engineer that\Nspecializes in dial ships,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:06.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.00,0:07:20.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:25.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You, down there, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:28.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, give me a ride! Please!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.43,0:07:31.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You want a ride? But this\Nis a one person boat.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:36.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't. There's no room.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.43,0:07:39.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Either give me the boat\Nor I'll slice you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:40.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:42.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZABO]\NGuerilla!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.67,0:07:47.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZABO]\NNo.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.72,0:08:09.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NIs this Eneru's doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.72,0:08:21.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NHow dare you harm Vearth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.69,0:08:35.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:41.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI screaming]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.90,0:09:05.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NGet some water\Ndials down here now!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.26,0:09:08.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The fire's spreading!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:14.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NForm up. Salute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.98,0:09:17.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WHITE BERETS]\N– Heso!\N– Heso!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:21.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good day. Heso!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.96,0:09:23.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are the White\NBerets doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.17,0:09:26.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, something\Nmust've happened.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.46,0:09:28.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are all warned to\Nuse extreme caution!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.96,0:09:30.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've received word\Nthat illegal entrants
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.86,0:09:35.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,have infiltrated Skypiea\Nthrough Angel Beach today.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.49,0:09:38.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are reportedly\Nseven suspects!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.16,0:09:39.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But do not worry!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.38,0:09:41.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can help with our\Nsearch and investigation
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.11,0:09:43.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by reporting all\Nsuspicious activity!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.08,0:09:45.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave it to the White Berets!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:49.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WHITE BERETS]\N– White Berets!\N– White Berets!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.50,0:09:50.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NDid you see that?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.91,0:09:53.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It appeared as if he was talking\Nto someone in the water.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.67,0:09:55.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI]\NHe was probably delusional.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.66,0:09:58.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHURA]\NWould someone\Nplease shut that dog up?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.92,0:10:01.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI]\NHe was most likely\Nbegging for his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:02.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.63,0:10:05.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NWhy did Eneru take\Ncare of that guy himself?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.17,0:10:08.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't that why he sent us\Nhere in the first place?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.43,0:10:10.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NWe probably ran out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.57,0:10:11.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI]\NRan out of time?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.51,0:10:14.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NYet another\Ngroup of illegal entrants
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.10,0:10:16.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,have already\Ninfiltrated Skypiea.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.98,0:10:18.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHURA]\NAgain?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.36,0:10:20.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NOld lady Amazon\Ninformed us that it's a ship
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.44,0:10:23.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with seven Blue Sea\Ndwellers on board.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.20,0:10:25.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NSeven Blue Sea dwellers?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.50,0:10:27.42,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That's probably us!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.50,0:10:29.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're here illeagally?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.24,0:10:31.16,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,But if you wish to proceed,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.25,0:10:32.91,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,you must first pay\Nthe entrance fee
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.00,0:10:35.21,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,of one billion\Nextols per person.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.29,0:10:37.21,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That is the law.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.80,0:10:43.87,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NBecause we didn't pay\Nthe entrance fee? No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.87,0:10:45.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NSeven heads.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.37,0:10:48.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like one of us is\Ngonna have to share.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.50,0:10:51.21,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhat the heck is\Nhappening on this island?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.67,0:10:53.30,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And who are those people?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.09,0:10:56.13,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThis is crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.01,0:11:07.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need to get back to\Nthe others to warn them.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.14,0:11:09.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just hope I get to them\Nbefore it's too late.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.29,0:11:17.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beat this one, Usopp! Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.61,0:11:20.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think that'll\Nbe a problem!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.01,0:11:27.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See? My cloud sculpture's so\Ngood it should be in a museum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:28.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NThat's amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.10,0:11:32.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the worst looking\Nart I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:33.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSo can you fix it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.92,0:11:36.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NI've never seen\Nparts like these before.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.51,0:11:38.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, just fix it already!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.30,0:11:39.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NI'm sorry,\Nbut until I have a chance
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.97,0:11:42.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to look at this closer,\NI don't know if I can fix it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.64,0:11:43.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Will you at least try?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.89,0:11:45.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NYes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:51.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.33,0:11:53.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like we have company.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:02.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NYou there! On the beach!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.59,0:12:03.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.85,0:12:06.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does he mean us?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.25,0:12:20.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHey, uh...\Nwhy are they crawling?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.15,0:12:22.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWho knows?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.23,0:12:25.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, they've\Nobviously got issues.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.24,0:12:28.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NBecause they're\Ncrawling around like crabs?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:32.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NWhite berets, halt!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.88,0:12:35.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WHITE BERETS]\N– Heso!\N– Heso!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.72,0:12:36.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NHeso.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.62,0:12:37.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NHeso, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.63,0:12:39.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SUU]\NSuu-suu.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.26,0:12:41.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Speak our language!\NWe can't understand you.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.05,0:12:43.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are they? Soldiers?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.76,0:12:45.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp said they have issues.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, look what we have here.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.76,0:12:49.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must be the\NBlue Sea dwellers
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.47,0:12:52.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who have illegally entered the\Nsovereign land of Skypiea!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.35,0:12:53.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.64,0:12:55.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Prepare to have the weight\Nof Heaven's Judgment
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.56,0:12:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,brought down upon you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.75,0:12:59.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're calling them criminals?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.40,0:13:01.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Illegal entry? What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.21,0:13:03.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NDon't waste your\Nbreath making excuses.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.42,0:13:05.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Amazon, the woman who\Nstands at Heaven's Gate,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.92,0:13:08.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,captured these very images\Nusing her vision dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:11.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, wait. That can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.26,0:13:13.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think this is all\Na big misunderstanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.28,0:13:14.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain McKinley.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.74,0:13:17.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're not the criminals\Nyou're making them out to be.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.62,0:13:19.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you mean\Nby illegal entry?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.79,0:13:21.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does this have to do\Nwith that ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:23.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,one billion extol entrance fee?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.66,0:13:25.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because we didn't\Npay her a thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.25,0:13:27.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But didn't that old lady say\Nwe didn't have to pay it?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.55,0:13:29.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not like she\Ntried to stop us.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.38,0:13:30.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.55,0:13:33.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough! There's no sense\Ntrying to deny it.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.35,0:13:34.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, fess up!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.42,0:13:37.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you need not\Nbecome panicked just yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.26,0:13:38.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,According to Heaven's Judgment,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.63,0:13:41.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Illegal Entry is only\Nan 11th degree crime!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.51,0:13:43.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once you accept\Nyour punishment...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:44.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which will be minimal...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:46.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you become legal\Ntourists on the spot
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.31,0:13:47.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and may go about your business.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.93,0:13:49.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you shoulda\Ntold us that sooner,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.95,0:13:51.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but before we accept,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.41,0:13:53.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what exactly do you have\Nplanned as far as punishment?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.62,0:13:54.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A mere slap on the wrist.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.08,0:13:58.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All you need to do is pay\Nten times the entrance fee.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.13,0:13:59.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course, if you\Npay immediately,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.92,0:14:02.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we'll pretend this little\Nepisode never happened.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.33,0:14:05.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, ten billion per person,\Ntimes seven people
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.67,0:14:08.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,makes your total\N70 billion extols.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.42,0:14:09.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cash only.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.33,0:14:11.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, 70 billion extols?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.06,0:14:13.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That sounds like an\Nawful lotta money!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.04,0:14:15.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How much is that in berries?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.54,0:14:18.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the currency used\Nin the Blue Sea World, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.13,0:14:21.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Today's exchange rates are\N10,000 extols per berry.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.63,0:14:23.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's see now,\Nthere's, uh, 10,000,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:25.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and you gotta carry\Nthe one, and, uh,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.29,0:14:26.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is there a decimal in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.83,0:14:28.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Five?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.27,0:14:31.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seventy billion extols is seven\Nmillion berries, genius.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.31,0:14:34.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get real! Do you realize\Nhow expensive that is?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.48,0:14:36.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After risking our lives\Ncoming to this place,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.60,0:14:38.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,why should we have\Nto pay a stupid fee
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.23,0:14:40.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,just to enter your\Nprecious city?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.19,0:14:41.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't agree to that!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.57,0:14:43.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NYou brought this on yourselves.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.34,0:14:46.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you had just paid the 700,000\NBerries in the first place,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.78,0:14:48.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be having this talk.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.49,0:14:51.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NThat's still way too expensive!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.77,0:14:53.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is your first warning.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.37,0:14:57.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The White Berets serve under\Nthe vassals of almighty Eneru.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.29,0:14:59.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arguing with us will only raise\Nthe level of your crime.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.96,0:15:02.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NOh, whatever, man.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.38,0:15:03.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's forget these idiots.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.81,0:15:05.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to start looking for\NNami. I'm getting worried.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.93,0:15:08.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She may need my tender\Naffections right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.55,0:15:09.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NIs she in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:10.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI doubt it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.43,0:15:18.85,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThose weird guys\Nfrom earlier somehow knew
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.93,0:15:20.89,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,about us coming to Skypiea.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.98,0:15:23.56,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That means Luffy and the\Nothers may be in trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.65,0:15:25.27,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Better hurry back!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.02,0:15:31.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI can't wait to ride this thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.05,0:15:32.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope you can fix it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.38,0:15:36.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NThis waver\Nlooks downright abused!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.42,0:15:39.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I find out you're responsible\Nfor this damage,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.09,0:15:41.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you're looking at a\Ntenth degree crime:
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.59,0:15:43.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Destruction of Sky\NIsland Property
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.60,0:15:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by a Blue Sea Dweller."
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.93,0:15:47.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Captain McKinley,\Nthis is my fault.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.18,0:15:49.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I crashed the waver, not him.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.23,0:15:50.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah, besides,\Nthis thing's mine.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.05,0:15:53.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NIs that right?\NSounds suspicious to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.92,0:15:56.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was under the impression\Nwavers didn't exist
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.30,0:15:57.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the Blue Sea World.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.39,0:15:59.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If this one was stolen\Nfrom Skypiea,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.51,0:16:01.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the degree of your\Ncrime will increase!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:04.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not stolen!\NWanna fight about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.35,0:16:06.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NExcuse me?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.93,0:16:09.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOh, no, there's\Na whole group of people!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.60,0:16:12.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope they're not\Nthose guys from before.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoever they are,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.69,0:16:16.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope Luffy's not pulling\Nany of his usual stunts.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.36,0:16:18.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's sit down and take\Na breather, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.30,0:16:20.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro, Luffy, Chopper,\Nthere's no reason for us...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.30,0:16:22.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.30,0:16:25.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, baby! I missed you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.59,0:16:29.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLuffy! Promise you won't\Nstart any trouble, okay?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.51,0:16:31.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDon't know if I\Ncan keep that promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.18,0:16:32.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.73,0:16:35.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need you to fork up seven\Nmillion berries from your stash
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.07,0:16:36.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to pay for all the fines we got!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:39.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, good! So we pay the\Nfine and we're clear?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.73,0:16:42.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did he say seven million?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.37,0:16:47.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NHm? What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.48,0:16:50.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYou're ripping us off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:16:59.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NOh, crap!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.33,0:17:01.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was so worked up I forgot\Nto hit the brakes!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.98,0:17:02.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– Ouch.\N– Ouch.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.91,0:17:04.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WHITE BERETS]\N– Captain!\N– Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.78,0:17:06.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHey, thanks for letting\Nme use your waver.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.34,0:17:07.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I love the way it handles.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.00,0:17:09.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NI'm glad you enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.55,0:17:10.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But more importantly,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.76,0:17:12.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,do you realize how much\Ntrouble you're in now?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.80,0:17:13.89,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[WHITE BERET A]\NCaptain...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.97,0:17:15.39,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NAMI]\NGuys, let's make\Nourselves scarce.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:16.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAww. Aren't you gonna finish
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:17.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the fight you just started?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.89,0:17:19.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NTrust me, this\NEneru is not someone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:20.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we wanna mess with.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, quite.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.20,0:17:24.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And knocking out an official\Nis a crime of the fifth degree.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.23,0:17:28.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once you're found guilty of\Ncommitting a fifth degree crime,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.28,0:17:29.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,almighty Eneru will banish you
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.90,0:17:31.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the land of the\Ndrifting clouds.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.86,0:17:33.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How's that bad?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.28,0:17:35.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NLand of the drifting clouds?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.24,0:17:36.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.95,0:17:39.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a death sentence. You die!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.63,0:17:41.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll put you and your\Nship on a small cloud
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.84,0:17:43.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and set you adrift in the sea
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.43,0:17:45.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with no chance of\Nrescue or escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.05,0:17:49.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll eventually die a very\Nslow and painful death.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.72,0:17:51.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's terrible!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.62,0:17:52.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.99,0:17:55.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That must be why we saw\Nthat ship fall from the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.69,0:17:57.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you\Ntalking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.52,0:17:59.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember that\Ngalleon we saw falling?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.94,0:18:02.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The St. Briss,\NI think it was called.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.40,0:18:03.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For all we know,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.78,0:18:06.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that crew could've been\Npunished over 200 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.69,0:18:13.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WHITE BERETS]\N– You! Criminals!\N– You! Criminals!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.36,0:18:15.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITE BERET B]\NDo you scum know\Nwhat you've done to our Captain?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.74,0:18:16.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.61,0:18:18.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji, let me handle this.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.28,0:18:19.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anything for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.79,0:18:22.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't take it so personally.\NIt was a lucky shot!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.45,0:18:23.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITE BERET B]\NA lucky shot?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.86,0:18:25.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NCompletely unintentional!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.78,0:18:26.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.95,0:18:28.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NNo, I'm telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.44,0:18:30.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but can you blame a\Nbeginner for messing up
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.32,0:18:32.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and nearly killing your boss?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.15,0:18:33.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThat's weird,\Nseemed like you had
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.49,0:18:35.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a pretty good handle\Non it to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.11,0:18:36.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NShuddup!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.53,0:18:37.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quiet, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.07,0:18:40.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami's trying to trick them into\Nthinking it was an accident.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.58,0:18:41.95,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't blow it, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.04,0:18:43.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.21,0:18:44.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NGentlemen.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.33,0:18:46.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As important as your\Ninvestigation is,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.08,0:18:49.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,perhaps it would be best to get\Nthe captain to a doctor first.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.21,0:18:50.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh. Right! The captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.82,0:18:54.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NNow, there's no reason to panic.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.32,0:18:55.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's take him to my house.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.96,0:18:57.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll get right on that.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.35,0:18:58.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WHITE BERETS]\N– Heso!\N– Heso!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:01.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITE BERET B]\NConsider yourselves under
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:03.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,preliminary arrest.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.27,0:19:05.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't go anywhere! Got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.40,0:19:08.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The poor captain's bleeding!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.49,0:19:09.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhy are they crawling again?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.68,0:19:12.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't they just carry him\Nlike normal people?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.51,0:19:13.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys saved my life,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.84,0:19:16.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I know you're not as bad\Nas they claim you are.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.71,0:19:19.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So take this chance\Nand get out of here!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.25,0:19:20.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.98,0:19:24.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI think we'd\Nbetter take her advice.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.94,0:19:27.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I was on the waver,\NI saw it for myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.27,0:19:29.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,An island filled with monsters!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.70,0:19:31.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great, so you did\Nexactly what everyone
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.74,0:19:33.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was hoping you wouldn't do.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.25,0:19:36.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean the place we were\Ntold to never ever set foot on?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.11,0:19:36.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And there's monsters?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.98,0:19:39.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Don't give 'im any ideas!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.01,0:19:41.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's nothing to get\Nexcited about, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.84,0:19:44.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The last thing we need is\Nto get involved with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:47.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Regardless, we're\Nleaving, now let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.17,0:19:49.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NAh, it'll break my\Nheart to be away from Conis,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.80,0:19:51.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but if that's what\NNami wants, so be it.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.84,0:19:53.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIf we stick around any longer,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.20,0:19:55.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis and Pagaya may get\Nin trouble because of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.22,0:19:57.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThat's true.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those White Berets will charge\Nthem as our accomplices!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.87,0:20:01.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we can escape now on our own,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.58,0:20:03.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then it shouldn't cause\Nthem any trouble, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.63,0:20:05.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, how can\Nthey be helping us
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.15,0:20:06.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when they're with that captain?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.61,0:20:09.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's the plan. Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.25,0:20:16.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.49,0:20:17.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are we running away?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.16,0:20:20.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThey haven't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.21,0:20:21.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoever arrests\Nthem is an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:28.42,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NPlease. Please hurry.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.29,0:20:31.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Blue Sea dwellers\Nwill never escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.53,0:20:35.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.03,0:20:38.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't you two argue on\Nthe boat? Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.62,0:20:40.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How many times do\NI have to tell you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.57,0:20:44.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Staying here equals more\Ntrouble for everybody!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.60,0:20:46.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.62,0:20:47.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.45,0:20:49.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NSave yourselves!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.34,0:20:50.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.42,0:20:51.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh. Just great.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.04,0:20:53.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NBe careful, miss.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.25,0:20:55.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you say anything to\Ndefend these criminals,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.12,0:20:58.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will consider you and\Nyour father accomplices.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.33,0:21:01.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These people must be punished\Nto the full extent of the law
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.69,0:21:05.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for all the abusive language\Nand deplorable violence.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.15,0:21:08.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I find them guilty of\Nfifth degree crimes.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.03,0:21:10.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In the name of almighty Eneru,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.80,0:21:14.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you are banished to drift\Nin the clouds for eternity.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.95,0:21:16.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you, it was an accident!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.87,0:21:18.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh. Forget it.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.45,0:21:20.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arrest them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:23.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just run! You can't win!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.17,0:21:28.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[MCKINLEY]\NFire the milky arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.90,0:21:29.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelps]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.07,0:21:31.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go, Nami! Run!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.32,0:21:32.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYa think?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.08,0:21:37.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.41,0:21:39.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:41.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.92,0:21:44.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NWhite Berets! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.74,0:21:54.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITE BERETS chuckling]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.83,0:21:57.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cool trick! Mind if I try?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:21:59.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.19,0:22:04.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.60,0:22:11.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see his arm?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.36,0:22:13.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS]\NLook! He's all stretchy!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.40,0:22:14.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope he's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.57,0:22:16.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.74,0:22:20.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.03,0:22:22.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way! devil fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.62,0:22:25.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\N...Fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.92,0:22:31.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITE BERETS yell]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.32,0:23:03.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NPiece of cake.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.50,0:23:06.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! How's the money\Nsituation looking?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.67,0:23:08.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NFifty thousand berries left!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.46,0:23:11.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NFifty thousand?\NWe're that broke?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.13,0:23:14.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NNormally that'd last\Nus a day or two at most.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.09,0:23:16.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?\NWhy are we so poor?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.34,0:23:19.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everybody! Your\Ncaptain has something to say!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.10,0:23:21.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone on my ship\Nneeds to be more good
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.14,0:23:22.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with money from now on!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.19,0:23:23.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So lead by example!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.88,0:23:24.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.76,0:23:25.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.81,0:23:27.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In any case,\Nthe Fighting Formation B
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.81,0:23:29.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I taught them to use\Nwas successful.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.64,0:23:30.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's that.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.40,0:23:31.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.77,0:23:33.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They defeated the White Berets.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.48,0:23:35.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.02,0:23:36.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At this altitude,\Nthe athletic ability
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.98,0:23:40.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of Blue Sea dwellers\Nusually decreases.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.94,0:23:45.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.56,0:23:47.94,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NThose poor deluded fools.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.07,0:23:51.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NSorry, criminals!\NYou have no chance of escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.28,0:23:52.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHm?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.38,0:23:53.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NYou should have behaved
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.62,0:23:56.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and done what I told you to do.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.33,0:23:59.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of all the upholders\Nof Law here in Skypiea,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.68,0:24:02.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we White Berets are\Nthe most lenient.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.22,0:24:06.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,However, they are not\Nnearly as forgiving!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.73,0:24:08.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.61,0:24:10.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\NCongratulations!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.19,0:24:13.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are now considered\Nsecond degree criminals.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.69,0:24:16.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can try to cry for mercy...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.23,0:24:18.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.15,0:24:20.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MCKINLEY]\N...but you will all be judged...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.50,0:24:23.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...by the Priests of Upper Yard!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.81,0:24:25.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heso!
